Builds bridge approaches for a dragged bridge span.1/ Drag along the bridge direction to set the span and drag sideways to set the approach width.2/ The tool grades one or both ends up to the bridge deck height and chooses approach lengths from the current terrain and maximum grade.Controls:- Release the mouse to place the approaches.- Alt+Scroll adjusts bridge height.- Shift+Scroll adjusts maximum grade.- Ctrl+Scroll cycles which side receives an approach: both, start, end, or none.- Wider drags create wider approaches, up to 10 tiles.- Press Esc to cancel.Requires SC4TerrainExtensions.dll to work.